@api = http://localhost:5100

### Liveness: the process is up
GET {{api}}/health/live

### Readiness: dependencies are reachable
GET {{api}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json

# Auth: the API sets HttpOnly cookies, which the HTTP client keeps between
# requests. Passwords are prompted for, never saved in this file.

### Sign up
# @prompt password
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.test",
  "username": "demo",
  "displayName": "Demo User",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Sign in with email or username
# @prompt password
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "demo",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/api/v1/auth/me

### Rotate the refresh token
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Sign out
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/logout
